      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "最近、エプラさんの姿を見ない。\n体調を崩していないか気になった僕は洞窟の奥へと向かった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "984045afeac261ae42ba94cc9f57b82e63db2b3a50e7b8e13289d28c3cf0b816",
      "grid_index": 0,
