      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "エプラさん、僕の部屋に毎日来てたのに。\n怪我とかしてないと良いんだけど……。",
      "jp_sha256": "5b964f2a50352ff2050a208599a8ec4236fc62cd6fabb74174164bc2086d3da7",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "에프라 씨, 매일 제 방에 왔었는데.\n다치거나 한 게 아니면 좋겠는데…….",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3395ad0a6ba5cd7e7fbbde38331cfc85141e40a64f4323e321c8ffc65687951d:000002_3864053674774760484:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "エプラさん、僕の部屋に毎日来てたのに。\n怪我とかしてないと良いんだけど……。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6f854a2e88664b074282afe19f2855957f67fe018a86436bea8f4b76e9e7954c",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "しつこいくらいに僕の元を訪れ、\n中毒になったかのように匂いを嗅いでいたエプラさん。\nそんな彼女を探して、暗がりの先へと進んでいくと――。",
      "jp_sha256": "d72aac3f5bd69964136d6140da75cea3166eb1b7cf9008f5f528268d9076c26c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "성가실 정도로 나를 찾아와\n중독된 것처럼 냄새를 맡던 에프라 씨.\n그런 그녀를 찾아 어둠 속으로 나아가자――.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
